cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the papers listed under references."
type: software
title: "osht: spherical harmonic transforms on optimal-dimensionality (L^2) samples"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zubairkhalid1/osht"
url: "https://zubairkhalid1.github.io/osht"
abstract: >-
  Forward and inverse spherical harmonic transforms of band-limited signals from
  exactly L^2 samples on the sphere. The forward transform is an O(L^3)
  interpolated elimination with no linear solves and no precomputation, with
  two exact back-ends, multi-pass refinement and ring placements optimised for
  stability.
